{"lines":[{"id":"s1","text":"Two bows, two claps.|Pray, bow once."},{"id":"s2","text":"All eyes on you.|Wrong order."},{"id":"s3","text":"Shrine rules.|Follow them."},{"id":"s4","text":"Coins in.|Bow, bow."},{"id":"s5","text":"The miko arrives.|Hands together."},{"id":"s6","text":"She—"},{"id":"s7","text":"You wait.|The incense drifts."},{"id":"s8","text":"Clap, clap.|One last bow."},{"id":"s9","text":"Two bows, two claps.|One wish, one bow."},{"id":"n1","text":"Bow twice.|Before you pray."},{"id":"n2","text":"Clap twice.|Hands together."},{"id":"n3","text":"One bow.|To finish."},{"id":"n4","text":"That's Japan first times.|Follow for more."}],"rate":"+8%","voice":"en-US-GuyNeural"}